msgstr "これは剃れない！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS"
