msgstr "もう刈り株さえ残っちゃいない！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.RIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.RIDING"
