msgstr "燃料を入れないと動かないぞ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON"
