msgstr "溶鉱炉だと思ったんだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKE"
