msgstr "ツル植物の一種だろうか…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL"
