msgstr "「なんでも治る！ヘビの油」か…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN"
