msgstr "キモチ悪いな…でも、なぜか気になる…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT"
