msgstr "ははは、ヘビ。お前の骨は私の物だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_FIRE"
