msgstr "ちょっと筋っぽくて固いな～"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BAT_HIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BAT_HIDE"
