msgstr "おかしいな～。ブタ革みたいに見える。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR"
