msgstr "どっかで、のんびり釣りしたいよね～"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT"
