msgstr "あれは使えるのか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
