msgstr "うわー！遺物の頭部。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
