msgstr "これがあれば速く進める。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_STICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_STICK"
