msgstr "海の鳥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER"
