msgstr "クソ！腐ったんだ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM"
