msgstr "ニンニクと澄ましバターをつけたいネ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON"
