msgstr "食べる前に料理するのが一番だろうネ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_POISON_COOKED"
