msgstr "これを食べる危険を冒すべきかナ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.DEAD"
