msgstr "この脚は何かに使えそうだヨ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG_POISON.GENERIC"
