msgstr "アア、神様ッ！毒雲だヨ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GASHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GASHAT"
