msgstr "ちっこいけど、珍味ネ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOWFLY.DEAD"
