msgstr "僕の鍋のほうが上質だネ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLD_DUST"
