msgstr "手で切るには長すぎるよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_TALL.PICKED"
