msgstr "ささないよりはマシ、ってとこネ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WATER"
