msgstr "コウモリのフン、ダネ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUMMY_CAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUMMY_CAKE"
