msgstr "こういう音が好きな生き物もいるノ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PANGOLDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PANGOLDEN"
