msgstr "硬いナッツもラクラク割れるネ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIGBANDIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIGBANDIT"
