msgstr "花束を作ろう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_FLORIST.SLEEPING"
