msgstr "たいまつを置くのにピッタリの場所だな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_TORCH_WALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_TORCH_WALL"
