msgstr "魔法のものだらけだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_BANK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_BANK.BURNING"
