msgstr "キッチンでの事故、大混乱？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_FLORIST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_FLORIST.GENERIC"
