msgstr "何て名前か忘れたけど、アレのレシピだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_WEAPONS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_WEAPONS.BURNING"
