msgstr "いつかね..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.SOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_CITY.SOLD"
