msgstr "味のある家を作るための材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_GOTHIC_CRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_GOTHIC_CRAFT"
