msgstr "味のある家。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_MANOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_MANOR"
