msgstr "屋根を作るための材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TUDOR_CRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TUDOR_CRAFT"
