msgstr "家の、キッチンがある家のための材料！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_TURRET_CRAFT"
