msgstr "理に適ったメゾン。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA"
