msgstr "深～い秘密を秘めてるヨ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.QUACKENBEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.QUACKENBEAK"
