msgstr "鳥の肉を手にする簡単な方法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TUBERTREE"
