msgstr "神秘的なウロコ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON"
