msgstr "胎内に炎を抱くベルセルクか！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONDEN"
