msgstr "戦士の心の臓が脈打つ音が聞こえるぞ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART"
