msgstr "我専用の、木イチゴの泉だ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE"
