msgstr "鞍上の敵！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING"
