msgstr "乗り物と同様の悪夢を見るがよい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.UNDUNGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.UNDUNGED"
