msgstr "これは間違いなく巨人の落とし物であろう！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DUNGPILE.PICKED"
