msgstr "戦場より剥ぎ取りし地表だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEACH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEACH"
msgid "Feels good between my toes."
msgstr "素足で踏むと、実に心地よい"

