msgstr "他人の作業を打ち消すのはいい気分だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANGING_VINE"
