msgstr "少なくとも殻は新鮮だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HARPOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HARPOON"
