msgstr "心地良く生温かい。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNING"
