msgstr "この生垣を刈り込もうって誰も思わなかったのか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM"
