msgstr "庭にやや高級感が生まれる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HIPPOPOTAMOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HIPPOPOTAMOOSE"
