#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_HERRINGBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_HERRINGBONE"
