#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_TRANSITIONAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_TRANSITIONAL"
