msgstr "んー、ちょっとかわいすぎない？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_MARBLE"
