msgstr "この金を便利な物に換えられるかな？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_CITYHALL.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_CITYHALL.BURNING"
