msgstr "こういう下の方が好きみたいだ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIFEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIFEPLANT"
