msgstr "話しかけたら、なんかしゃべるかな？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST"
