msgstr "…表皮…焦げてイル…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.GENERIC"
