msgstr "なんだこれ…草？ヘンなの…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.PICKED"
