msgstr "オレたちもときどき、お風呂で寝ちゃうよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
