msgstr "僕らを助けてくれるって言った、彼だよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMSANDWICH"
