msgstr "すっげー！入ってみようよ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK"
