msgstr "…本体ハ…どこダ…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
