msgstr "ふう、もう命の心配はないね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC"
