msgstr "具合悪くなったときに食べると、治るよ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VENUS_STALK"
