msgstr "うわー…マジかよ～…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF"
