msgstr "あれ？船はどこいっちゃったんだ…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE"
