msgstr "草を何本か一緒に縛ったもの。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE"
