msgstr "月って、空に浮いてる光の玉じゃないの？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS"
