msgstr "じきに針葉樹が育つでしょう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIRATEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIRATEGHOST"
