msgstr "超常海賊現象のようですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIRATEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIRATEHAT"
