msgstr "宝物を収めるのに、うってつけですよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT"
