msgstr "これではもう、ただのゴミですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC"
