msgstr "住宅の建築に使える。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOUSE_VILLA_CRAFT"
