msgstr "住宅の建築に使える。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POG.APORKALYPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POG.APORKALYPSE"
