msgstr "睡眠中のオオカミギツネです。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POISONCROCODOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.POISONCROCODOG"
