msgstr "イニシャルの「W」がロゴで入ってます。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PORTAL_SHIPWRECKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PORTAL_SHIPWRECKED"
