msgstr "農産業複合体の最大の功績ですよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPE"
