msgstr "類人猿の巣のようですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PROP_DOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.PROP_DOOR"
