msgstr "苦痛を与えて服従させる道具ですよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN"
