msgstr "海賊船ですね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT"
