msgstr "海賊船の帆ですよ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE"
