msgstr "骨でできたカギですね…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2"
