msgstr "何のカギでしょうか？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3"
