msgstr "実に興味をそそられますね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WOOD_DOOR"
