msgstr "どう見ても怪しいから、燃やしちゃおう！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_VOLCANO_ERUPT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_VOLCANO_ERUPT"
