#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT"
