msgstr "可燃性じゃないね。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_BRICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYERHOUSE_BRICK"
