msgstr "ドロドロの地面だ～"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK"
