msgstr "悲しそう…元気出せ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL"
