msgstr "オレ様のお口に、入れッ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED"
