msgstr "寝てる。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.UNDUNGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.UNDUNGED"
