msgstr "やっぱり釣りはいいよな"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH4_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH4_COOKED"
