msgstr "いい色してんじゃねぇか"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH5_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH5_COOKED"
