msgstr "ポテトチップスがあったらいいのに。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.BLUEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.BLUEFISH"
