msgstr "木を十分切ってからのごほうび！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEDTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEDTEA"
