msgstr "勢いがなくなってきたな"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.NORMAL"
