msgstr "さてと、ピーナッツバターを探さなきゃ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG"
