msgstr "おかしなヤツだな。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JELLYBUG_COOKED"
