msgstr "ま、料理しても、うまそうには見えねえな"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_DEAD"
