msgstr "干し肉か…ふるさとの味だ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP"
