msgstr "切るの、楽しかったぜ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.GENERIC"
