#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SUITCASE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_INTRO_SUITCASE"
