msgstr "変な扉だな、ルーシー？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ROWBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.ROWBOAT"
