msgstr "見てるだけで口ん中が乾いてくるぜ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SAND"
