msgstr "いい感じに見える。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
