msgstr "すげぇ勢いで燃えてるぜ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW"
