msgstr "裁縫はかなり得意だぜ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWSKITTISH_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHADOWSKITTISH_WATER"
