msgstr "切らずには、いられねぇな…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL"
