msgstr "あいつには近づかないでおこう。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_BONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_BONE"
