msgstr "初めて見る植物だ。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.SLEEPING"
