msgstr "こいつぁ、上等な武器だぜ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN"
