msgstr "地面の下にァ、海は、ねェよな…？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT"
