#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
