msgstr "こいつ、なかなかいい目してやがるゼ"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING"
