msgstr "昼寝中みてェだな"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CHICKEN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CHICKEN.DEAD"
