msgstr "害虫の侵入を防ぐもの。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CORK_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CORK_BAT"
