msgstr "トウモロコシか！今日はツイてるゼ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED"
