msgstr "焼きトウモロコシは大好物だゼ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS"
