msgstr "カニの野郎、いいとこに住んでやがるな…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CRATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CRATE"
