msgstr "なかなかオシャレじゃねェか"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.FISH3_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.FISH3_COOKED"
