#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
