msgstr "黒い炎だゼ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK"
