msgstr "宝箱じゃァ、なさそうだゼ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH"
