msgstr "長げェ航海にも持ってけるゼ！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MERM"
