msgstr "用心したほうがいいゼ…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
