msgstr "シッ！あっちいけ、害虫め！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
