msgstr "シーレッグス号の世話は、誰がすンだ？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON"
msgid "Thet'll give Sea Legs a leg up! Harr!"
msgstr "これでシーレッグス号の整備は完璧だゼ"

